old text-foreground text-3xl\">Shipping Information</h1></div><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Everything you need to know about our shipping and delivery services</p></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><section><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-6 font-semibold text-foreground text-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-credit-card w-6 h-6\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"5\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg>Shipping Rates</h2><div class=\"gap-6 grid md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 dark:from-blue-950/20 to-blue-100 dark:to-blue-900/20 p-6 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-6 h-6 text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 text-xl\">Inside Dhaka</h3></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200\">Shipping Fee:</span><span class=\"font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 text-2xl\">৳80</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200\">Delivery Time:</span><span class=\"font-medium text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100\">1-2 Days</span></div><div class=\"pt-2 border-t border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-700\"><p class=\"text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-sm\">Same-day delivery available for orders placed before 2 PM</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 dark:from-green-950/20 to-green-100 dark:to-green-900/20 p-6 border border-green-200 dark:border-green-800 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-6 h-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-green-900 dark:text-green-100 text-xl\">Outside Dhaka</h3></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"text-green-800 dark:text-green-200\">Shipping Fee:</span><span class=\"font-bold text-green-900 dark:text-green-100 text-2xl\">৳150</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"text-green-800 dark:text-green-200\">Delivery Time:</span><span class=\"font-medium text-green-900 dark:text-green-100\">3-5 Days</span></div><div class=\"pt-2 border-green-200 dark:border-green-700 border-t\"><p class=\"text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 text-sm\">Free shipping on orders over ৳2000</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-muted/50 p-6 rounded-lg\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 font-semibold text-foreground text-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-6 h-6\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Delivery Areas</h2><div class=\"gap-6 grid md:grid-cols-2\"><div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-semibold text-foreground\">Inside Dhaka (৳80)</h3><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-muted-foreground text-sm\"><li>• Dhanmondi, Gulshan, Banani</li><li>• Uttara, Mirpur, Mohammadpur</li><li>• Old Dhaka, New Market</li><li>• Wari, Ramna, Tejgaon</li><li>• Bashundhara, Baridhara</li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-semibold text-foreground\">Outside Dhaka (৳150)</h3><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-muted-foreground text-sm\"><li>• Chittagong, Sylhet, Rajshahi</li><li>• Khulna, Barisal, Rangpur</li><li>• Comilla, Mymensingh</li><li>• All other districts nationwide</li><li>• Remote areas may take longer</li></ul></div></div></section><section><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-6 font-semibold text-foreground text-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package w-6 h-6\"><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path><path d=\"M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path></svg>How Shipping Works</h2><div class=\"gap-4 grid md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"p-4 border border-border rounded-lg text-center\"><div class=\"flex justify-center items-center bg-primary/10 mx-auto mb-3 rounded-full w-12 h-12\"><div class=\"text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-credit-card w-6 h-6\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"5\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg></div></div><div class=\"mb-1 font-semibold text-primary text-sm\">Step <!-- -->1</div><h3 class=\"mb-2 font-medium text-for